WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.300
The RCMP is an institution in systemic crisis.

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:09.500
Sexual harassment settlements exceeding 125 million dollars.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:13.862
A mass shooting in Nova Scotia driven by operational failure.

00:00:13.862 --> 00:00:18.662
A massive backlog of complaints indicating deep accountability gaps.
